From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Share original particle raster/quad writing and select native procedural streams
Upstream-base: 11c0bc65ad2ec21431c5d74f1ac4cbc1e3e2e2c3

Share the original renderer's raster and per-quad stream order. Select the original
textured-colour mesh writer with native width, bounds, frame-lifetime and coherent
host-array handling. Preserve signed16 / 1024 UV quantization and the original
vertex-colour material's direct draw branch. Static asset float UV streams remain
supported through their actual stride. This does not select full particle manager,
model/light/user callbacks, or synthetic texture handles.

